OL,3,GNEWSAHospital trust declares critical  
OL,4,Aincident                               
OL,6,FSherwood Forest Hospitals NHS          
OL,7,FFoundation Trust has declared a        
OL,8,Fcritical incident due to "sustained    
OL,9,Foperational pressures".                
OL,11,FThe trust, which runs King's Mill      
OL,12,FHospital in Sutton-in-Ashfield, Newark 
OL,13,FHospital and Mansfield Community       
OL,14,FHospital, announced the critical       
OL,15,Fincident in a statement on Wednesday   
OL,16,Fafternoon.                             
OL,18,FA spokesperson said: "Our hospitals are
OL,19,Fhere for you if you need them, but     
OL,20,Fplease be warned to expect delays while
OL,21,Fwe deal with this incident."           
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
